ntsize-12">--</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u65351762" id="u65351762"><p data-lake-id="972bae22a14a315792fae763814db79e" id="972bae22a14a315792fae763814db79e"><span data-lake-id="u91d6858d" id="u91d6858d" class="lake-fontsize-12">自减1</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u04c1ed90" id="u04c1ed90"><p data-lake-id="1b4c155178e3bfed48ae48b61ca7439b" id="1b4c155178e3bfed48ae48b61ca7439b"><span data-lake-id="u916f2756" id="u916f2756" class="lake-fontsize-12">a--, --b</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><ul list="ubf780d90"><li fid="u36c57660" data-lake-id="u3ced2321" id="u3ced2321"><span data-lake-id="uc1698a00" id="uc1698a00" class="lake-fontsize-12">前缀自加自减运算：先进行自加自减，再参与表达式运算</span></li><li fid="u36c57660" data-lake-id="uf65e17c9" id="uf65e17c9"><span data-lake-id="ubca72948" id="ubca72948" class="lake-fontsize-12">后缀自加自减运算：先参与表达式运算，在进行自加自减</span></li><li fid="u36c57660" data-lake-id="u18460e43" id="u18460e43" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u13ab77f6" id="u13ab77f6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">取模运算要求左右两边操作数必须是整型数据</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnint%20b%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20c%20%3D%20%2B%2Ba%3B%20%5Cnint%20d%20%3D%20b%2B%2B%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YigE5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="isPkr" id="isPkr"><span data-lake-id="u5f2c34a8" id="u5f2c34a8">关系运算符</span></h2><table data-lake-id="zc7Td" id="zc7Td" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 748px"><colgroup><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ub4d8d47f" id="ub4d8d47f" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ue0ecb214" id="ue0ecb214" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="d9272e998ac78b3307792e9e0c9b971e" id="d9272e998ac78b3307792e9e0c9b971e"><span data-lake-id="u3502625d" id="u3502625d" class="lake-fontsize-12">运算符</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf04c6085" id="uf04c6085" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="d213fef5f6d0e75680660c58acc4ad48" id="d213fef5f6d0e75680660c58acc4ad48"><span data-lake-id="ub8b694bd" id="ub8b694bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能说明</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6cab8f7d" id="u6cab8f7d" colSpan="2" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="5904fcd7a6809d26dbdc92d766d49fdd" id="5904fcd7a6809d26dbdc92d766d49fdd"><span data-lake-id="ub101c81b" id="ub101c81b" class="lake-fontsize-12">举例</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u58d493d6" id="u58d493d6" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u3dc71849" id="u3dc71849"><p data-lake-id="94f7c01211e7c8cd19e40c1aab277c0a" id="94f7c01211e7c8cd19e40c1aab277c0a"><span data-lake-id="uf4584bb4" id="uf4584bb4" class="lake-fontsize-12">&gt;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4454b210" id="u4454b210"><p data-lake-id="5f5ce4b0e7ba84824e95c1ba05b68aeb" id="5f5ce4b0e7ba84824e95c1ba05b68aeb"><span data-lake-id="ua030deeb" id="ua030deeb" class="lake-fontsize-12">大于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udd7c9149" id="udd7c9149"><p data-lake-id="9ec993b1c513e2f0cc147d090bc6bae2" id="9ec993b1c513e2f0cc147d090bc6bae2"><span data-lake-id="u42e135f1" id="u42e135f1" class="lake-fontsize-12">a &gt; b</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7d66e530" id="u7d66e530"><p data-lake-id="30c7bbd2236724a59662c90cda60fc99" id="30c7bbd2236724a59662c90cda60fc99"><span data-lake-id="u74f26f68" id="u74f26f68" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断a是否大于b</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u7ca14c7b" id="u7ca14c7b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uaad863cb" id="uaad863cb"><p data-lake-id="cb2c3fce2da8416c39127d7b6636460f" id="cb2c3fce2da8416c39127d7b6636460f"><span data-lake-id="uf528ec4c" id="uf528ec4c" class="lake-fontsize-12">&gt;=</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uef95d3b5" id="uef95d3b5"><p data-lake-id="87148aee6976ada67808061f95be8bf5" id="87148aee6976ada67808061f95be8bf5"><span data-lake-id="u4a1691ad" id="u4a1691ad" class="lake-fontsize-12">大于或等于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf7f9e3f7" id="uf7f9e3f7"><p data-lake-id="63a9dfe388e677d2ddcd491c1e68d2df" id="63a9dfe388e677d2ddcd491c1e68d2df"><span data-lake-id="u06556969" id="u06556969" class="lake-fontsize-12">a &gt;= 5</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1d88004f" id="u1d88004f"><p data-lake-id="23666c2a89a77507e9877c3967d27816" id="23666c2a89a77507e9877c3967d27816"><span data-lake-id="ub0dc20e0" id="ub0dc20e0" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断a是否大于或等于5</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc25691b9" id="uc25691b9" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u2ca9427b" id="u2ca9427b"><p data-lake-id="bd5d7b3e3252f034ead6511ef3a07eba" id="bd5d7b3e3252f034ead6511ef3a07eba"><span data-lake-id="uc37d73d3" id="uc37d73d3" class="lake-fontsize-12">&lt;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubc5e6119" id="ubc5e6119"><p data-lake-id="1a51613aa396c900954c90810491c71c" id="1a51613aa396c900954c90810491c71c"><span data-lake-id="u9eec7620" id="u9eec7620" class="lake-fontsize-12">小于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u50484f9f" id="u50484f9f"><p data-lake-id="d69de561c3ce0aa6725ed6913a3a7c10" id="d69de561c3ce0aa6725ed6913a3a7c10"><span data-lake-id="u32c4ec66" id="u32c4ec66" class="lake-fontsize-12">3 &lt; x</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud030b287" id="ud030b287"><p data-lake-id="258c11e8fe0ea80ed44141128c2767bd" id="258c11e8fe0ea80ed44141128c2767bd"><span data-lake-id="ufc67fb58" id="ufc67fb58" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断3是否小于x</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ue1cec5b8" id="ue1cec5b8" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u6f41f67d" id="u6f41f67d"><p data-lake-id="34723f60be591da1d57ff444fe50506d" id="34723f60be591da1d57ff444fe50506d"><span data-lake-id="u273e8ab7" id="u273e8ab7" class="lake-fontsize-12">&lt;=</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubb4f4805" id="ubb4f4805"><p data-lake-id="6970eb4134e3a2db7ea1b8d0e4e07f8b" id="6970eb4134e3a2db7ea1b8d0e4e07f8b"><span data-lake-id="u9211e30c" id="u9211e30c" class="lake-fontsize-12">小于或等于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u85b82a33" id="u85b82a33"><p data-lake-id="61786bd10187ffe17bebc8cef5ef4813" id="61786bd10187ffe17bebc8cef5ef4813"><span data-lake-id="ue4d96f86" id="ue4d96f86" class="lake-fontsize-12">x &lt;= (y+1)</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucd9cfbfa" id="ucd9cfbfa"><p data-lake-id="dcd68b65813c5f5812b67a744f542f59" id="dcd68b65813c5f5812b67a744f542f59"><span data-lake-id="ud79ab7df" id="ud79ab7df" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断x是否小于或等于y+1</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc3d99f88" id="uc3d99f88" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u4ba508e5" id="u4ba508e5"><p data-lake-id="be0295446b26036d5f8ca5385e95d5c9" id="be0295446b26036d5f8ca5385e95d5c9"><span data-lake-id="u3d31c71e" id="u3d31c71e" class="lake-fontsize-12">==</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9b0d3ca4" id="u9b0d3ca4"><p data-lake-id="b82b0bac3d095ac0cca71cbb280b47b8" id="b82b0bac3d095ac0cca71cbb280b47b8"><span data-lake-id="u567b89c3" id="u567b89c3" class="lake-fontsize-12">等于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1258258c" id="u1258258c"><p data-lake-id="85c3b0982afeff8f844b0eefda874329" id="85c3b0982afeff8f844b0eefda874329"><span data-lake-id="u609b21ba" id="u609b21ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">(x+1) == 0</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucd55e0a5" id="ucd55e0a5"><p data-lake-id="b97e544599b20a8b06d12d104f2a34fa" id="b97e544599b20a8b06d12d104f2a34fa"><span data-lake-id="u8d8fd55a" id="u8d8fd55a" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断x+1是否等于0</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u0ca5a220" id="u0ca5a220" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ua1dc4dee" id="ua1dc4dee"><p data-lake-id="b918a59d77ce428dbc1e6b544debe0da" id="b918a59d77ce428dbc1e6b544debe0da"><span data-lake-id="ubb5ec657" id="ubb5ec657" class="lake-fontsize-12">!=</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufb8db56d" id="ufb8db56d"><p data-lake-id="2cfd267ce3b28130da58f77be9e18061" id="2cfd267ce3b28130da58f77be9e18061"><span data-lake-id="u5534acd6" id="u5534acd6" class="lake-fontsize-12">不等于</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2c502f10" id="u2c502f10"><p data-lake-id="b4899261654ea4c9ef7076a0ffc98120" id="b4899261654ea4c9ef7076a0ffc98120"><span data-lake-id="ucaaa8f35" id="ucaaa8f35" class="lake-fontsize-12">c != ‘\0’</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u37f37841" id="u37f37841"><p data-lake-id="248c67b64276404803d2248400c20a78" id="248c67b64276404803d2248400c20a78"><span data-lake-id="uc878680a" id="uc878680a" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断c是否不等于'\0'</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u21664f63" id="u21664f63"><span data-lake-id="u85bf7993" id="u85bf7993">关系运算符的值为布尔值 也就是说要么关系成立(1) 要么不成立（0）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%20%3E%2010%20%5Cn20%20%3C%2030%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cnint%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%20int%20b%20%3D%2020%3B%5Cna%20!%3D%20b%3B%5Cna%20%3D%3D%20b%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BlnhW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u28211463" id="u28211463"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A5%2C%22id%22%3A%22l4S6t%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c2f4706" id="u7c2f4706" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="u079a0297"><li fid="ucbf990f5" data-lake-id="u06ddec74" id="u06ddec74"><span data-lake-id="ud3699343" id="ud3699343" class="lake-fontsize-12">关系运算符用于判断运算符两边的表达式是否满足给定的大小条件。</span></li><li fid="ucbf990f5" data-lake-id="ud1cdc6ae" id="ud1cdc6ae"><span data-lake-id="u659cc6e1" id="u659cc6e1" class="lake-fontsize-12">由关系运算符组成的表达式称为关系表达式，其值为布尔型</span></li><li fid="ucbf990f5" data-lake-id="ud6a90b8a" id="ud6a90b8a"><span data-lake-id="u0d408fc0" id="u0d408fc0" class="lake-fontsize-12">判断是否相等是双等号==，而不是一个等号</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="iQ9Hm" id="iQ9Hm"><span data-lake-id="u471b5af6" id="u471b5af6">逻辑运算符</span></h2><table data-lake-id="sqFT2" id="sqFT2" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u1187d4a6" id="u1187d4a6" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u4b219af2" id="u4b219af2" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="c713fbd6f7aca0204898e47901f7a70d" id="c713fbd6f7aca0204898e47901f7a70d"><span data-lake-id="ub14c54c9" id="ub14c54c9" class="lake-fontsize-12">运算符</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8a91e91d" id="u8a91e91d" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="0f834274fd34e53c4897dfa1d43a9c9a" id="0f834274fd34e53c4897dfa1d43a9c9a"><span data-lake-id="u4c4a4d5a" id="u4c4a4d5a" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能说明</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6d66064b" id="u6d66064b" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="96f715875cc16ed967c3592e6e4311df" id="96f715875cc16ed967c3592e6e4311df"><span data-lake-id="u81e80b49" id="u81e80b49" class="lake-fontsize-12">举例</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc5695626" id="uc5695626" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u3429d496" id="u3429d496"><p data-lake-id="e511e92d78c55ea6acd1ec51cbca126c" id="e511e92d78c55ea6acd1ec51cbca126c"><span data-lake-id="ud5d92edf" id="ud5d92edf" class="lake-fontsize-12">!</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u27268825" id="u27268825"><p data-lake-id="ab2661ab2f2fe3c582fa4fdc803e172a" id="ab2661ab2f2fe3c582fa4fdc803e172a"><span data-lake-id="u489d117d" id="u489d117d" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑反</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u04ed155d" id="u04ed155d"><p data-lake-id="bf9b2a39256780a0e631a60d4c322870" id="bf9b2a39256780a0e631a60d4c322870"><span data-lake-id="u0622f77f" id="u0622f77f" class="lake-fontsize-12">!(x==0)</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4583b277" id="u4583b277" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u7ede2401" id="u7ede2401"><p data-lake-id="662147f6954c6ae8adff0aa10c799b13" id="662147f6954c6ae8adff0aa10c799b13"><span data-lake-id="ucac21e6c" id="ucac21e6c" class="lake-fontsize-12">&amp;&amp;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u37fca181" id="u37fca181"><p data-lake-id="40a79271bceceb3597485d7b2ff39ea6" id="40a79271bceceb3597485d7b2ff39ea6"><span data-lake-id="u45a4c7aa" id="u45a4c7aa" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑与</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uffde9122" id="uffde9122"><p data-lake-id="1da6d1e0bc57f1ebe7525d947c88e45e" id="1da6d1e0bc57f1ebe7525d947c88e45e"><span data-lake-id="u2bbe6ed8" id="u2bbe6ed8" class="lake-fontsize-12">x&gt;0 &amp;&amp; x&lt;10</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2a756207" id="u2a756207" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ub88b1c0e" id="ub88b1c0e"><p data-lake-id="7751173a8bcf0310943b266c86b34692" id="7751173a8bcf0310943b266c86b34692"><span data-lake-id="u9aa88242" id="u9aa88242" class="lake-fontsize-12">||</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf0bf3be1" id="uf0bf3be1"><p data-lake-id="fc32ae020abe03822fc71904758d1289" id="fc32ae020abe03822fc71904758d1289"><span data-lake-id="ud3ee6f73" id="ud3ee6f73" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑或</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5f85b95d" id="u5f85b95d"><p data-lake-id="2e5c466ab7cb92532e78eac69cc22234" id="2e5c466ab7cb92532e78eac69cc22234"><span data-lake-id="ubc83018e" id="ubc83018e" class="lake-fontsize-12">y&lt;10 || x&gt;10</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><ul list="u53d87517"><li fid="ub7aedd6a" data-lake-id="ueb0fa984" id="ueb0fa984"><span data-lake-id="u4e1d6fe3" id="u4e1d6fe3" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑反：将逻辑真、假翻转，即真变假，假变真。</span></li><li fid="ub7aedd6a" data-lake-id="u798af257" id="u798af257"><span data-lake-id="ucb8e16fb" id="ucb8e16fb" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑与：将两个关系表达式串联起来，当且仅当左右两个表达式都为真时，结果为真。理解为电路的串联</span></li><li fid="ub7aedd6a" data-lake-id="uee577a98" id="uee577a98"><span data-lake-id="u76ba8178" id="u76ba8178" class="lake-fontsize-12">逻辑或：将两个关系表达式并联起来，当且仅当左右两个表达式都为假时，结果为假。理解为电路的并联</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="55eed7dd40d3e525fc71ccddcea3d803" id="55eed7dd40d3e525fc71ccddcea3d803" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560097533-30b0f6ee-de34-4ef2-a24a-29a3aa64534e.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A370%2C%22originHeight%22%3A79%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22exqB0%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><ul list="u2d309673"><li fid="ud94a73bf" data-lake-id="u1ddb3421" id="u1ddb3421"><span data-lake-id="u6696dcf9" id="u6696dcf9" class="lake-fontsize-12">在逻辑与运算中，如果左边表达式的值为假，那么右边表达式将不被执行。</span></li><li fid="ud94a73bf" data-lake-id="uaa9bf528" id="uaa9bf528"><span data-lake-id="u680d949d" id="u680d949d" class="lake-fontsize-12">在逻辑或运算中，如果左边表达式的值为真，那么右边表达式将不被执行。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cnint%20b%20%3D%2020%3B%5Cnif(a%20%3E%20b%20%26%26%20%2B%2Ba)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22111%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XQ74X%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="qyo7X" id="qyo7X"><span data-lake-id="u7dbba729" id="u7dbba729">位运算符</span></h2><table data-lake-id="sNww4" id="sNww4" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 748px"><colgroup><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u9972ea83" id="u9972ea83" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ucb899874" id="ucb899874" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="38fa4d422f0dc5296c061a9c4e1cd22f" id="38fa4d422f0dc5296c061a9c4e1cd22f"><span data-lake-id="u384d337f" id="u384d337f" class="lake-fontsize-12">运算符</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7adb0dc5" id="u7adb0dc5" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="54ff5aa73da3982d5f75e6a13fc6a018" id="54ff5aa73da3982d5f75e6a13fc6a018"><span data-lake-id="u9fb57e62" id="u9fb57e62" class="lake-fontsize-12">名称</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucfba91aa" id="ucfba91aa" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="853ef27c515cab84f774465a2e73735f" id="853ef27c515cab84f774465a2e73735f"><span data-lake-id="u9177cfa6" id="u9177cfa6" class="lake-fontsize-12">举例</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u745c29d4" id="u745c29d4" style="background-color: #a2d272"><p data-lake-id="fde02c68981e37ea3e45960d0dc6159b" id="fde02c68981e37ea3e45960d0dc6159b"><span data-lake-id="u9971b8b9" id="u9971b8b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u7b6ba87e" id="u7b6ba87e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uaf129474" id="uaf129474"><p data-lake-id="ee36e7dda7ecd68573396195c0b24e23" id="ee36e7dda7ecd68573396195c0b24e23"><span data-lake-id="u31e8289f" id="u31e8289f" class="lake-fontsize-12">~</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5c4911ae" id="u5c4911ae"><p data-lake-id="e45c83cefce1381aa038d3b785ac2490" id="e45c83cefce1381aa038d3b785ac2490"><span data-lake-id="ud3974ec2" id="ud3974ec2" class="lake-fontsize-12">位逻辑反</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5b0f0115" id="u5b0f0115"><p data-lake-id="8f4ec32149198246c743908b9a978a7c" id="8f4ec32149198246c743908b9a978a7c"><span data-lake-id="u7dc8207d" id="u7dc8207d" class="lake-fontsize-12">~a</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u07a14632" id="u07a14632"><p data-lake-id="f81ed418a47298514a408c68fac61de7" id="f81ed418a47298514a408c68fac61de7"><span data-lake-id="u0c1bf93d" id="u0c1bf93d" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 a 中的每一位取反</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u97dcf77e" id="u97dcf77e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u1090cc02" id="u1090cc02"><p data-lake-id="194031e666c1fc262caa24f97dddb9b4" id="194031e666c1fc262caa24f97dddb9b4"><span data-lake-id="u19a4e0fb" id="u19a4e0fb" class="lake-fontsize-12">&amp;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u79430468" id="u79430468"><p data-lake-id="59affb2f69684a5d98d9273c039b3030" id="59affb2f69684a5d98d9273c039b3030"><span data-lake-id="u8002ce0a" id="u8002ce0a" class="lake-fontsize-12">位逻辑与</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud00bc5fd" id="ud00bc5fd"><p data-lake-id="055986101c79475e0cfa53ebb8358ec3" id="055986101c79475e0cfa53ebb8358ec3"><span data-lake-id="u0871f860" id="u0871f860" class="lake-fontsize-12">a &amp; b</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u345e08cb" id="u345e08cb"><p data-lake-id="6b4d4219d3ffc443c2fab69ea32994d6" id="6b4d4219d3ffc443c2fab69ea32994d6"><span data-lake-id="u9420a7ea" id="u9420a7ea" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 a 和 b 逐位进行与操作</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u3c95a593" id="u3c95a593" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u372e087e" id="u372e087e"><p data-lake-id="92ea918cf2a1fc4aff36afb6a5a4257f" id="92ea918cf2a1fc4aff36afb6a5a4257f"><span data-lake-id="ua1ea7b94" id="ua1ea7b94" class="lake-fontsize-12">|</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6965b0f4" id="u6965b0f4"><p data-lake-id="3d1e3bfb916d3811a9c97a4d719b3f60" id="3d1e3bfb916d3811a9c97a4d719b3f60"><span data-lake-id="uf43cf556" id="uf43cf556" class="lake-fontsize-12">位逻辑或</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua745fdf4" id="ua745fdf4"><p data-lake-id="aabe93fff90c631a9401c80bbcd77b89" id="aabe93fff90c631a9401c80bbcd77b89"><span data-lake-id="ub476add3" id="ub476add3" class="lake-fontsize-12">a | b</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u61894c4f" id="u61894c4f"><p data-lake-id="347a4bff0629c82c2f1eaf13cf257d30" id="347a4bff0629c82c2f1eaf13cf257d30"><span data-lake-id="ucc52a14a" id="ucc52a14a" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 a 和 b 逐位进行或操作</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua018b286" id="ua018b286" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u8caefecc" id="u8caefecc"><p data-lake-id="1d7ed4a55f5c0e9937eee6dba1796aa7" id="1d7ed4a55f5c0e9937eee6dba1796aa7"><span data-lake-id="u7e84ec32" id="u7e84ec32" class="lake-fontsize-12">^</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u302ce580" id="u302ce580"><p data-lake-id="bf15d253b020328561213203ba880822" id="bf15d253b020328561213203ba880822"><span data-lake-id="ub40154ba" id="ub40154ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">位逻辑异或</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub41e0b9e" id="ub41e0b9e"><p data-lake-id="57bbea52b1095af93edc4862b92e5ad7" id="57bbea52b1095af93edc4862b92e5ad7"><span data-lake-id="uc8f0adca" id="uc8f0adca" class="lake-fontsize-12">a ^ b</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3cede869" id="u3cede869"><p data-lake-id="97c930eb10389fa1d6851c07e512884c" id="97c930eb10389fa1d6851c07e512884c"><span data-lake-id="u42b90ef3" id="u42b90ef3" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 a 和 b 逐位进行异或操作</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="udc1d187a" id="udc1d187a" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ua1d74b0b" id="ua1d74b0b"><p data-lake-id="aa1d2c91514d30e7b845a97aea50b90e" id="aa1d2c91514d30e7b845a97aea50b90e"><span data-lake-id="udf8cae2e" id="udf8cae2e" class="lake-fontsize-12">&lt;&lt;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf7f96c34" id="uf7f96c34"><p data-lake-id="1394515c34bf17bb0e7b6be2a8a38393" id="1394515c34bf17bb0e7b6be2a8a38393"><span data-lake-id="u73c9b3be" id="u73c9b3be" class="lake-fontsize-12">左移</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue0f644cc" id="ue0f644cc"><p data-lake-id="2823d22df4d95348c86240b0d38b264a" id="2823d22df4d95348c86240b0d38b264a"><span data-lake-id="u81bdc9c0" id="u81bdc9c0" class="lake-fontsize-12">a &lt;&lt; 4</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u234cd669" id="u234cd669"><p data-lake-id="297f29946fabdcd8550e7cd5e3538a7e" id="297f29946fabdcd8550e7cd5e3538a7e"><span data-lake-id="u493c59c0" id="u493c59c0" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 a 中的每一位向左移动4位</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ucec5f8f9" id="ucec5f8f9" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u8ef078f4" id="u8ef078f4"><p data-lake-id="45e17ab2b2d775ba7333ad5dfa51dc5e" id="45e17ab2b2d775ba7333ad5dfa51dc5e"><span data-lake-id="u7a0e142b" id="u7a0e142b" class="lake-fontsize-12">&gt;&gt;</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2807ca5c" id="u2807ca5c"><p data-lake-id="8b94ad2b429e51a5562cdfc5fbdfbf89" id="8b94ad2b429e51a5562cdfc5fbdfbf89"><span data-lake-id="u6e791f46" id="u6e791f46" class="lake-fontsize-12">右移</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub2c560cc" id="ub2c560cc"><p data-lake-id="3f38adb7f059b827d043d8efba64b799" id="3f38adb7f059b827d043d8efba64b799"><span data-lake-id="u7999b322" id="u7999b322" class="lake-fontsize-12">x &gt;&gt; 4</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1acc90f8" id="u1acc90f8"><p data-lake-id="6ba9948375da3bee69b8f4f13eba0470" id="6ba9948375da3bee69b8f4f13eba0470"><span data-lake-id="ue1119808" id="ue1119808" class="lake-fontsize-12">将变量 x 中的每一位向右移动4位</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="1b88e8b1c4ecc06155279f6d32ff6b97" id="1b88e8b1c4ecc06155279f6d32ff6b97"><span data-lake-id="u20e74d77" id="u20e74d77" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><ul list="ua7791436"><li fid="u618c9f62" data-lake-id="ucbab07ac" id="ucbab07ac"><span data-lake-id="u9538d689" id="u9538d689" class="lake-fontsize-12">位运算符操作的对象是数据中的每一位</span></li><li fid="u618c9f62" data-lake-id="u2f70186a" id="u2f70186a"><span data-lake-id="u1996a5da" id="u1996a5da" class="lake-fontsize-12">位逻辑反、位逻辑与、位逻辑或拥有与逻辑运算相似的规则和一样的真值表</span></li><li fid="u618c9f62" data-lake-id="u72d8ea60" id="u72d8ea60"><span data-lake-id="u0e190ac5" id="u0e190ac5" class="lake-fontsize-12">异或运算：相同为0，不同为1   </span></li><li fid="u618c9f62" data-lake-id="u6a4c4e3b" id="u6a4c4e3b"><span data-lake-id="ua9445f47" id="ua9445f47" class="lake-fontsize-12">移位运算：移出去的不要，空出来的补零（例外情况：如果做移位运算的操作数是一个有符号数，且做右移运算，此时移出去的不要，空出来的补原符号位）</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22unsigned%20char%20ret%20%3D%20~0x05%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25hhu%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cret)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25hhd%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cret)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pOVUz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u2c64adef" id="u2c64adef"><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%26%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%BA1%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%89%8D%E4%B8%BA1%5Cn%5Cn-%201%20%26%201%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn-%201%20%26%200%20%3D%3D%200%5Cn-%200%20%26%200%20%3D%3D%200%5Cn-%200%20%26%201%20%3D%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn-%20%7C%20%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E4%BD%8D%E6%88%96%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%BA1%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%89%8D%E4%B8%BA1%5Cn%5Cn%20%20-%201%20%7C%201%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20-%201%20%7C%200%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20-%200%20%7C%201%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20-%200%20%7C%200%20%3D%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn-%20%5E%20%3A%20%E6%8C%89%E4%BD%8D%E5%BC%82%E6%88%96%20---%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BA1%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BA0%5Cn%5Cn%20%20-%201%20%5E%200%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20-%200%20%5E%201%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20-%200%20%5E%200%20%3D%3D%200%5Cn%20%20-%201%20%5E%201%20%3D%3D%200%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v5vxm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u69b23b74" id="u69b23b74"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A6%E7%A7%BB%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22rk4ZF%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ude48684d" id="ude48684d" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="uc4164b97" class="lake-list"><li fid="ubbe976d9" version="1735652329200" data-lake-id="u34edcb80" id="u34edcb80" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="u533c3f51" id="u533c3f51" class="lake-fontsize-12">无符号左移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u70936cd0" id="u70936cd0"><span data-lake-id="u29185d26" id="u29185d26" class="lake-fontsize-12">法一：移出的丢弃，空出来的补 0</span></p><p data-lake-id="u184a3cc3" id="u184a3cc3"><span data-lake-id="u774dfa8b" id="u774dfa8b" class="lake-fontsize-12">法二：</span><span data-lake-id="ub33e10d1" id="ub33e10d1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">只要不越界，满足 number*2^n</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22unsigned%20int%20a%20%3D%203%20%3C%3C%203%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sf9v2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="uce019e06" class="lake-list"><li fid="u3b09921e" version="1735652553968" data-lake-id="u9bdf6b70" id="u9bdf6b70" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ff10f5a" id="u0ff10f5a" class="lake-fontsize-12">有符号左移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue8199693" id="ue8199693"><span data-lake-id="uc303dbfe" id="uc303dbfe" class="lake-fontsize-12">有符号数使用补码表示（其绝对值变符号后，取反后加 1）----》左移操作（移除的丢弃，空的补 0）----》还成原码（减 1 后取反）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20-9%20%3C%3C%203%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YfROy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u13fe33c8" id="u13fe33c8"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u79b334fa" id="u79b334fa"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B3%E7%A7%BB%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22yPns8%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u3861ffdf" id="u3861ffdf" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="u7077469f" class="lake-list"><li fid="uc9bab586" version="1735654039492" data-lake-id="u5cf5361f" id="u5cf5361f" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e550f75" id="u4e550f75" class="lake-fontsize-12">无符号右移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e8e99ac" id="u6e8e99ac"><span data-lake-id="udc7625a6" id="udc7625a6" class="lake-fontsize-12">法一：移出的丢弃，空出来的补 0</span></p><p data-lake-id="u83c4fcd1" id="u83c4fcd1"><span data-lake-id="ua3f17dca" id="ua3f17dca" class="lake-fontsize-12">法二：</span><span data-lake-id="ub96509ca" id="ub96509ca" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">只要不越界，满足 number/2^n</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22unsigned%20char%20a%20%3D%20151%20%3E%3E%205%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C2Lon%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="uea6fb81b" class="lake-list"><li fid="ud665ed10" version="1735654201470" data-lake-id="uc181e389" id="uc181e389" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="u36b3a2af" id="u36b3a2af" class="lake-fontsize-12">有符号右移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8cbde751" id="u8cbde751"><span data-lake-id="u5169b910" id="u5169b910" class="lake-fontsize-12">有符号数使用补码表示（其绝对值变符号后，取反后加 1）----》右移操作（移除的丢弃，空的补 符号位）----》还成原码（减 1 后取反）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20a%20%3D%20-96%20%3E%3E%205%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Om4Mm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="uc02229b1" id="uc02229b1"><span data-lake-id="u2282c0bc" id="u2282c0bc" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9c36c584" id="u9c36c584"><span data-lake-id="ud1132625" id="ud1132625" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="Kr4K3" id="Kr4K3"><span data-lake-id="ub745f395" id="ub745f395">特殊运算符</span></h2><ul list="u824fdbaa"><li fid="u1e185002" data-lake-id="u077d1a52" id="u077d1a52"><span data-lake-id="u71fc7767" id="u71fc7767" class="lake-fontsize-12">赋值运算符</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="2dd7c3b62276d46773c4ba7f45a32879" id="2dd7c3b62276d46773c4ba7f45a32879"><span data-lake-id="udf0bece6" id="udf0bece6" class="lake-fontsize-12">不能对常量赋值，只能对变量赋值</span></p><p data-lake-id="206f66eb6aa2987ce360ac86911238c4" id="206f66eb6aa2987ce360ac86911238c4"><span data-lake-id="u2f50f7fd" id="u2f50f7fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">不能直接对数组赋值</span></p><p data-lake-id="68f6d1a4046630d3a625b8897e9bc400" id="68f6d1a4046630d3a625b8897e9bc400"><span data-lake-id="u0e046f4c" id="u0e046f4c" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以连续赋值，顺序从右到左</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%2C%20b%3B%5Cnint%20x%5B5%5D%3B%5Cn%5Cna%20%3D%20100%3B%20%5Cn3%20%3D%20100%3B%20%5Cnx%20%3D%20123%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%5Cna%20%3D%20b%20%3D%2050%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%85%88%E5%B0%86%2050%20%E8%B5%8B%E7%BB%99%20b%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%86%20b%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E8%B5%8B%E7%BB%99%20a%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DbHFm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u89a131dd"><li fid="u8721d6b9" data-lake-id="uc57b72f2" id="uc57b72f2"><span data-lake-id="u4b183d35" id="u4b183d35" class="lake-fontsize-12">复合赋值符</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="d374d04714d9b07f4e0de3400409ce75" id="d374d04714d9b07f4e0de3400409ce75"><span data-lake-id="ub6a9c304" id="ub6a9c304" class="lake-fontsize-12">当左右两边有相同的操作数时，采用复合赋值符不仅直观，且能提高运算效率</span></p><p data-lake-id="e03c0251c4d1518db7ed8b5cc5895b9d" id="e03c0251c4d1518db7ed8b5cc5895b9d"><span data-lake-id="ub73edd35" id="ub73edd35" class="lake-fontsize-12">除了下述10个复合运算符之外，生造别的复合运算符是非法的</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%8A%A0%E5%87%8F%E4%B9%98%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%9A%5Cna%20%2B%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%2Bn%3B%5Cna%20-%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a-n%3B%5Cna%20*%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a*n%3B%5Cna%20%2F%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%2Fn%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%B1%82%E4%BD%99%EF%BC%9A%5Cna%20%25%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%25n%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%8D%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%9A%5Cna%20%26%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%26n%3B%5Cna%20%7C%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%7Cn%3B%5Cna%20%5E%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%5En%3B%5Cna%20%3E%3E%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%3E%3En%3B%5Cna%20%3C%3C%3D%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20a%3C%3Cn%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ndKIq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="ub7768793"><li fid="ua1e4a790" data-lake-id="ufa84562e" id="ufa84562e"><span data-lake-id="ue3579dcc" id="ue3579dcc" class="lake-fontsize-12">条件运算符（三目运算符）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ec854a75de07a0e8c8ceecb448777f2a" id="ec854a75de07a0e8c8ceecb448777f2a"><span data-lake-id="u16551b2c" id="u16551b2c" class="lake-fontsize-12">语法：表达式1 ? 表达式2 : 表达式3</span></p><p data-lake-id="3edb5f3b7c6fca85e19aa42c0b791660" id="3edb5f3b7c6fca85e19aa42c0b791660"><span data-lake-id="u28605477" id="u28605477" class="lake-fontsize-12">当表达式1为真时，取表达式2，否则取表达式3</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnint%20b%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cnint%20m%20%3D%20(a%3Eb)%20%3F%20a%20%3A%20b%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%20a%3Eb%20%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%20m%20%E5%8F%96%20a%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E5%8F%96%20b%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i5yCD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u0bf41832"><li fid="u1b8c3d10" data-lake-id="ua725cca2" id="ua725cca2"><span data-lake-id="uef74f1d0" id="uef74f1d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">sizeof 运算符</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="5a5c093f5c782159a9dcb4e6891b30bf" id="5a5c093f5c782159a9dcb4e6891b30bf"><span data-lake-id="ud7e430f6" id="ud7e430f6" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算指定数据类型或者变量所</span><span data-lake-id="ub20e8078" id="ub20e8078" class="lake-fontsize-12">占据内存的字节数</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sizeof(int))%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sizeof(long%20double))%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20a%5B5%5D%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sizeof(a))%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sizeof%20a)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P111H%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="uaaea5f33"><li fid="uab4870a5" data-lake-id="ufe106650" id="ufe106650"><span data-lake-id="u7d32220c" id="u7d32220c" class="lake-fontsize-12">return运算符</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9f1f3b1ab4eecc937b0fef90f9b31956" id="9f1f3b1ab4eecc937b0fef90f9b31956"><span data-lake-id="ud7d2ae01" id="ud7d2ae01" class="lake-fontsize-12">退出某个函数（如果退出的是主函数main，那么整个程序也就退出了）</span></p><p data-lake-id="2e0b9138736a9f748a5e275f3a5ccca7" id="2e0b9138736a9f748a5e275f3a5ccca7"><span data-lake-id="u5f0cace6" id="u5f0cace6" class="lake-fontsize-12">必须出现在函数体内，可以带函数对应类型的数据</span></p><ul list="u0c902189"><li fid="ue52f236e" data-lake-id="ufad0af02" id="ufad0af02"><span data-lake-id="u82bbcfdd" id="u82bbcfdd" class="lake-fontsize-12">逗号运算符</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="6b390347d0c0780d8b9700b40f279a45" id="6b390347d0c0780d8b9700b40f279a45"><span data-lake-id="u9660fa23" id="u9660fa23" class="lake-fontsize-12">逗号运算符(优先级最低),从左往右运算</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%EF%BC%88%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F1%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F3%EF%BC%8C...%20%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8Fn%EF%BC%89%5Cn%E6%B1%82%E5%80%BC%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%5Ct%E5%85%88%E6%B1%82%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%B1%82%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%B1%82%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F3%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E6%B1%82%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8Fn%5Cn%5Ct%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E9%80%97%E5%8F%B7%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BAn%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%5Cn%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%201.%E9%83%BD%E5%A5%BD%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E7%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%5Cn%20%20%20%202.%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%8E%E5%B7%A6%E5%BE%80%E5%8F%B3%5Cn%20%20%20%203.%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E5%A5%BD%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%96%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%80%E5%8F%B3%E8%BE%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GEZg2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%202%2C%20b%20%3D%203%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20ret%20%3D%20(a%3Eb%2Ca%2B%2B%2Cb%2B%2B%2Ca)%3B%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cret)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bfbet%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="X8gix" id="X8gix"><span data-lake-id="u52989311" id="u52989311">2.优先级与结合性</span></h1><p data-lake-id="7df890bc83acc982be67a90b9f3131be" id="7df890bc83acc982be67a90b9f3131be"><span data-lake-id="ud81ae54c" id="ud81ae54c" class="lake-fontsize-12">当表达式中出现不同的运算符时，根据优先级来决定谁先执行，比如先乘除，后加减</span></p><p data-lake-id="fdac3407c1c91eebc6a73dfda4a49305" id="fdac3407c1c91eebc6a73dfda4a49305"><span data-lake-id="ud5d49c94" id="ud5d49c94" class="lake-fontsize-12">当表达式中出现多个相同优先级的运算符时，根据结合性来决定谁先运行，比如从左到右</span></p><p data-lake-id="34b9ed73c9564a1fe7d963984b133bf1" id="34b9ed73c9564a1fe7d963984b133bf1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560098021-9f5b2eb8-a870-445e-a264-ba71d6e67f7c.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A494%2C%22height%22%3A656%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A694%2C%22originHeight%22%3A922%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22afMSh%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="AyITu" id="AyITu"><span data-lake-id="u111cec54" id="u111cec54">3.表达式与语句</span></h1><p data-lake-id="931aa1db57a1d53ec1437862fd37c6e9" id="931aa1db57a1d53ec1437862fd37c6e9"><span data-lake-id="u21d486ed" id="u21d486ed" class="lake-fontsize-12">表达式：每个表达式都有一个值</span></p><p data-lake-id="e0bfbd04026da36061479f16a6beeb67" id="e0bfbd04026da36061479f16a6beeb67"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560098217-d14da6b7-4c96-4f0c-bd96-dd5bd3dafdd5.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1140%2C%22originHeight%22%3A231%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kJVfm%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="b48426f047794876ea89bb9bbf236345" id="b48426f047794876ea89bb9bbf236345"><span data-lake-id="u57bab133" id="u57bab133" class="lake-fontsize-12">语句：是c程序的基本构建块，一条语句相当于一条完整的计算机指令，在c中，大部分语句以分号结尾。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="GQtJe" id="GQtJe"><span data-lake-id="u459951c8" id="u459951c8">4.问与答</span></h1><p data-lake-id="40bd103aa0e85290e0605a445606ae49" id="40bd103aa0e85290e0605a445606ae49"><span data-lake-id="u3e4299b4" id="u3e4299b4" class="lake-fontsize-12">我注意到C语言没有指数运算符。如何求一个数的幂呢？ </span></p><ul list="u48a69f21"><li fid="ua22d1db4" data-lake-id="uc24e7752" id="uc24e7752"><span data-lake-id="u93ac8ac6" id="u93ac8ac6" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过重复乘法运算的方法可以进行整数的较低的整数次幂运算（i * i * i 是i 的立方运算）。如果想计算非整数次幂或者高次幂，可以调 用pow 函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9412df4dd2d2d25d00cad66141de0577" id="9412df4dd2d2d25d00cad66141de0577"><span data-lake-id="u64afc48a" id="u64afc48a" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言为什么提供++ 和-- 运算符？它们是比其他的自增、自减 方法执行得快，还是仅仅更便捷？</span></p><ul list="ue0506d21"><li fid="ud04aab28" data-lake-id="uf8dc47f1" id="uf8dc47f1"><span data-lake-id="u978e700c" id="u978e700c" class="lake-fontsize-12">这种用法是用B语言继承而来的，对于现 代编译器而言，使用++ 和-- 不会使编译后的程序变得更短小或更 快，继续普及这些运算符主要是由于它们的简洁和便利</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f227dccf5673cedfbcec76a44ab74412" id="f227dccf5673cedfbcec76a44ab74412"><span data-lake-id="ud0664a68" id="ud0664a68" class="lake-fontsize-12">++ 和-- 是否可以处理float 型变量？</span></p><ul list="u6d2e29ad"><li fid="u5a15038d" data-lake-id="u62c8f56f" id="u62c8f56f"><span data-lake-id="u69e7e156" id="u69e7e156" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以。自增和自减运算也可以用于浮点数，但实际应用中极少采 用自增和自减运算符处理float 型变量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="78b52c2d3a25a4bf3f501a96b2113a9a" id="78b52c2d3a25a4bf3f501a96b2113a9a"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="Hvl5L" id="Hvl5L"><span data-lake-id="u171fea83" id="u171fea83">5、练习</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u859177f4" id="u859177f4"><br></p>